 "notes": [
  "Rows 2026-11-19 (lane narva-pilot-20261116): walls[0] from crop w01-320 (2018-06-21): four fronts at 5.3, 10.6 and 16.0 m of 20.8 m (yellow brick with three tall narrow windows and one pale-surround window, dark grey brick with pale frames, red brick with brick pilasters between the window columns, yellow brick with wide windows). walls[2] from w05-320: dark brown brick, brown frames, pale sill and head bands (its diamond brick panels over the doors: no kit part). walls[1] crop w04-321 (2017) shows the building under construction: nothing written.",
  "The W wall (surfaces 12, 22) is left to otherWalls: its group read the set-back storey's 15.9 m eaves against the 12.9 m roof edge (eaves gate), and its crop w03-254 is 18 deg oblique."
 ]
